WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.425
Unit fourteen. Dengue and Mosquitoes!

2
00:00:04.374 --> 00:00:08.010
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:11.553
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.603 --> 00:00:15.593
Today we learn about Dengue and Mosquitoes. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.373 --> 00:00:19.740
Dengue. Say it with me. Dengue!

6
00:00:23.262 --> 00:00:27.129
Mosquito. Say it with me. Mosquito!

7
00:00:30.629 --> 00:00:33.912
Fever. Say it with me. Fever!

8
00:00:37.416 --> 00:00:40.599
Net. Say it with me. Net!

9
00:00:44.081 --> 00:00:47.915
Water jar. Say it with me. Water jar!

10
00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:54.632
Cover. Say it with me. Cover!

11
00:00:58.151 --> 00:01:01.268
Doctor. Say it with me. Doctor!

12
00:01:04.785 --> 00:01:08.535
Rest. Say it with me. Rest!

13
00:01:12.014 --> 00:01:21.195
Dengue is an illness spread by mosquitoes. It can cause a high fever. We cover every water jar, sleep under a net, and see a doctor quickly if we have a fever.

14
00:01:21.245 --> 00:01:22.419
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.737 --> 00:01:28.597
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.647 --> 00:01:29.797
Fever!

17
00:01:30.743 --> 00:01:35.838
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.888 --> 00:01:37.038
Doctor!

19
00:01:37.866 --> 00:01:44.132
Did you know? The mosquito that spreads dengue often bites during the day, not only at night!

20
00:01:44.182 --> 00:01:46.100
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.796 --> 00:01:54.748
Think and answer. How can your family stop mosquitoes at home?

22
00:01:54.798 --> 00:01:55.948
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.236 --> 00:02:01.963
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.013 --> 00:02:04.652
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

